---
// Contact + community / call-for-contributions block.
---
<section id="contact" class="content-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contact and Community</h2>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="c-card">
        <h3>Get in touch</h3>
        <p>
          For tutorial questions, materials, or collaboration, email the organizing contacts.
        </p>
        <div class="emails">
          <a href="mailto:zihanw@u.northwestern.edu" class="email-pill">zihanw@u.northwestern.edu</a>
          <a href="mailto:manling.li@northwestern.edu" class="email-pill">manling.li@northwestern.edu</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="c-card">
        <h3>Contribute a failure mode</h3>
        <p>
          We welcome reproducible triggers, trace examples, and verified fixes, including high-quality
          negative results. Submissions feed the tutorial's diagnostics gallery.
        </p>
        <p class="c-emphasis">
          What we look for: a minimal setup, an operational definition, a trace, and a sanity-checked fix.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="c-card">
        <h3>Stay in the loop</h3>
        <p>
          Slides, recordings, and code will be released here after EMNLP 2026.
        </p>
        <p>
          Companion venue: the <a class="subtle-link" href="https://failure-mode-agent.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          FAGEN workshop</a> at ICML 2026 covers the same agenda in long form.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #contact { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 4rem 1rem; }

  .section-container { max-width: var(--page-max-width, 1100px); margin: 0 auto; }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2a2f6c;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }

  .c-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e6e8ef;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.6rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .c-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(42, 47, 108, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(42, 47, 108, 0.06);
  }

  .c-card h3 {
    color: #2a2f6c;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .c-card p {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .c-emphasis {
    background: #f0f1f8;
    border-left: 3px solid #2a2f6c;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #444;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }

  .emails {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .email-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #f0f1f8;
    color: #2a2f6c;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .email-pill:hover { background: #e3e5f5; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .section-title { font-size: 1.9rem; }
  }
</style>
